-- ============================================================================
-- 1. Autonomic Leakage: Conscious Policy Cannot Mask Autonomic Observables
-- ============================================================================
-- An autonomic observable `auto : S → Y` is unfakeable under a conscious modulation
-- `mask : S → S` when `∀ s, auto (mask s) ≡ auto s` (e.g. locus coeruleus pupillometry,
-- 40-200 ms periocular micro-expressions bypassing cortical suppression).
Unfakeable : {S Y : Type 0} → (S → Y) → (S → S) → Type 0
Unfakeable {S} {Y} auto mask = (s : S) → auto (mask s) ≡ auto s
